  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview&#xA;Set option DataTable info.&#xA;&#xA;Function modle : RFC_READ_TABLE  have &quot;OPTIONS&quot; in &quot;Tables&quot;.&#xA;The &quot;OPTIONS&quot; field is an item for entering data extraction conditions.&#xA;&#xA;The extraction conditions entered in the Excel file must be input to &quot;OPTIONS&quot;field after conversion according to DataType.&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_dt_InputExcel as Excel file to import &lt;DataTable&gt;&#xA;out_dt_Options as OPTIONS DataTable &lt;DataTable&gt;" DisplayName="SetOptionDataTable" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_4">
